H1: no quantum advantage in the pre-registered primary cell.
Rule: intersection-union, Wilcoxon signed-rank on 20 paired seeds, alpha 0.05 two-sided.
Selection of both arms is by inner-CV only. The confirmatory arm is 250 per class.

